      "content": "that gingerbread man thing is a bit weird lol. anyway i dont want to call the police or anything, i just wanted to know if there's a way to track the actual work order once it's filed? like an online portal or a reference number? it just keeps happening at the exact same time every day so it feels like something is specifically wrong with the timer or the wiring.",
